# Conformance probe pack for the transform `iso8601_si` (spec 0.55) on the
# `json` wire. Public. No kinds. One key, time_ms, at two members: `ms` as the
# integer, so an instant is given exactly, and `t` through `iso8601_si`.
# Decode takes the earliest line whose member is present (Version 0.6, One key
# at several locators); encode writes both.
format  conformance-si-time
version 0.55.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
wire    json
field   time_ms  ms  int
field   time_ms  t   iso8601_si
